### Test 1: Create a Ticket (The "Happy Path")
POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: first-try-101

{
  "subject": "Internet is slow",
  "body": "My connection has been dropping all morning.",
  "customer_email": "arwa@example.com"
}


### Test 2: Duplicate Key (Testing Idempotency)
POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: first-try-101

{
  "subject": "Internet is slow",
  "body": "My connection has been dropping all morning.",
  "customer_email": "arwa@example.com"
}

### Test 3: Bad Data (Testing Zod Validation)
POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: error-test-99

{
  "subject": "Missing Body",
  "customer_email": "user@test.com"
}

---
### NEW: GET ENDPOINTS (Pagination & Filtering)

### Test 4: Get Tickets (Defaults - Page 1, Limit 10)
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 5: Get Tickets with Pagination (Page 2, 5 items)
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets?page=2&limit=5
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 6: Search Tickets by Subject
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets?search=Internet
Content-Type: application/json

### Test 7: Combined Search and Pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets?search=slow&page=1&limit=2
Content-Type: application/json